OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:       
OL,6,FTurning cloudier Tuesday, with rain    
OL,7,Fpossible later. Generally cloudy and   
OL,8,Fchilly Wednesday and Thursday with     
OL,9,Fpatchy rain possible, especially for   
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures near or just   
OL,11,Fbelow average.                         
